  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2503001",
      "subQuestName": "Listen to what Alem is saying",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250300201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250300201": {
            "id": "250300201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's train her \"observation\" first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300202"
            ]
          },
          "250300202": {
            "id": "250300202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Sounds good. Let's head to the training grounds then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300203"
            ]
          },
          "250300203": {
            "id": "250300203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...There are really training grounds?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300204"
            ]
          },
          "250300204": {
            "id": "250300204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "...*cough* Keep it down, would you? I busted my chops finding this place. Our tribe uses it for training anyway, it just happens to be undergoing maintenance recently.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300205"
            ]
          },
          "250300205": {
            "id": "250300205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "So though some mechanisms don't work... And others are partially dismantled... It's more than sufficient for training...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300208"
            ]
          },
          "250300208": {
            "id": "250300208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Sorry, sorry... *sigh* Look, this was the best I could do. It was hard enough to find a relatively safe spot as it is, and I don't have what it takes to give Alem a convincing demonstration...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300209"
            ]
          },
          "250300209": {
            "id": "250300209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "#Help us, {NICKNAME}, you're our only hope! Please, if only for Alem's sake.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300210"
            ]
          },
          "250300210": {
            "id": "250300210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "If we don't give her good advice and find something for her to do, she'll run off from the tribe herself, and then who knows what kinda crazy hijinks she'll get into?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300211"
            ]
          },
          "250300211": {
            "id": "250300211",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Fine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300212"
            ]
          },
          "250300212": {
            "id": "250300212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Thank you so much! Phew... I can finally relax a bit...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300213"
            ]
          },
          "250300213": {
            "id": "250300213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tahmures",
            "text": "#Okay! Let's head out sooner rather than later. Alem, you be sure to watch what {NICKNAME} does carefully, okay?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300214"
            ]
          },
          "250300214": {
            "id": "250300214",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Alem",
            "text": "Got it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300215"
            ]
          },
          "250300215": {
            "id": "250300215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "...*sigh* I can't believe we're tricking a kid like this. Wayob, please do not blame me, I don't know what else we can do..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503003",
      "subQuestName": "Demonstrate \"observation\" for Alem",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250300301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250300301": {
            "id": "250300301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Ahem! We're here! This is the training grounds for honing your \"observation.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300302"
            ]
          },
          "250300302": {
            "id": "250300302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "It may look all flat and unassuming, but there's a ton of explosive mechanisms buried underground.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300303"
            ]
          },
          "250300303": {
            "id": "250300303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "If you don't exercise good judgment and move too hastily, you might trigger one of them, and then boom! It'll rock you, and down to the ground you go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300304"
            ]
          },
          "250300304": {
            "id": "250300304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Normally, we Children of Echoes use our Tepetlisaurus partners to help us excavate the target mechanisms while avoiding the obstacles.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300305"
            ]
          },
          "250300305": {
            "id": "250300305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "However, as archaeologists, we must consider all kinds of extreme circumstances.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300306"
            ]
          },
          "250300306": {
            "id": "250300306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "So... In this training, you can only rely on your powers of observation to find and excavate the buried targets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300307"
            ]
          },
          "250300307": {
            "id": "250300307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "#Okay, next up, {NICKNAME} will demonstrate how to properly dig those mechanisms up!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503004",
      "subQuestName": "Dig out the buried target mechanisms",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250300401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250300401": {
            "id": "250300401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Alem",
            "text": "Tahmures... Do you archaeologists really have to take tough classes like this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300402"
            ]
          },
          "250300402": {
            "id": "250300402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tahmures",
            "text": "That's a given! And this is nothing. Once you start formally studying, then you'll find out what \"tough\" really means...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300403"
            ]
          },
          "250300403": {
            "id": "250300403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Alem",
            "text": "Oh..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503005",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Akeor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250300501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250300501": {
            "id": "250300501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tahmures",
            "text": "You've got some serious skill... You dug up the buried mechanisms in no time flat, and not only that... Your clothes aren't even mussed up. You probably weren't ever even knocked over by the explosives.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300502"
            ]
          },
          "250300502": {
            "id": "250300502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tahmures",
            "text": "Thank goodness! We're so lucky to have run into someone as amazing as you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300503"
            ]
          },
          "250300503": {
            "id": "250300503",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Alem",
            "text": "Awesome!!! I wanna try too! Akeor, Akeor, let me, let me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300504"
            ]
          },
          "250300504": {
            "id": "250300504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "No need to be so hasty, Alem. We have to reset the field first. Once everything's ready, I'll bring you back here and walk you through it step by step.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300505"
            ]
          },
          "250300505": {
            "id": "250300505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "But before that, you have to stay with Tahmures and not run off, you hear?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300506"
            ]
          },
          "250300506": {
            "id": "250300506",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Alem",
            "text": "I know, I know. I'll listen to her, and I definitely won't run off!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300507"
            ]
          },
          "250300507": {
            "id": "250300507",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tahmures",
            "text": "That's a good kid, Alem. Now come on over, I'll read you some articles related to archaeology. Make sure you pay attention...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300508"
            ]
          },
          "250300508": {
            "id": "250300508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "#Phew... Thank you so much for your help, {NICKNAME}. I don't know what we'd have done without you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300509"
            ]
          },
          "250300509": {
            "id": "250300509",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You could've just demonstrated yourself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300510"
            ]
          },
          "250300510": {
            "id": "250300510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Me? *sigh* Don't even joke about that. If I didn't dig those treasures up, I'm afraid I wouldn't even be able to guarantee Tahmures's safety.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300511"
            ]
          },
          "250300511": {
            "id": "250300511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "And I don't know when she plans to start her next archaeological dig... No, no, wait, if she finishes her expedition, then she'll return to Sumeru, and then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300512"
            ]
          },
          "250300512": {
            "id": "250300512",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Oh! I... Y—You didn't hear anything. Here's your reward, please, just hurry up and take it, no need to stand on ceremony.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250300513"
            ]
          },
          "250300513": {
            "id": "250300513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Akeor",
            "text": "Alright, I need to go set things up again. Ugh... What should I bury this time? Maybe I should just bury some Grainfruit..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
